        {
          "id": "figure-2",
          "say": "All positions interact in one parallel step with self-attention. A recurrent layer must process tokens in order, so each token waits for the previous hidden state, forcing sequential steps that grow with sentence length. As an illustrative analogy, it is like messaging everyone together versus relaying a message down a line.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "zoom",
              "target": "tab1"
            },
            {
