        {
          "id": "result-1",
          "say": "The Transformer trains much faster on translation than recurrent alternatives because self-attention runs in parallel across positions. The base model finishes in 12 hours and the big model in 3.5 days on eight P100 GPUs. The plot titled BLEU dev against PPL dev shows perplexity on the horizontal and BLEU on the vertical, with better up-left, where big sits above base, while single-head and two-layer variants sit lower-right.",
          "actions": [
