          "say": "Translation quality reaches a new state of the art on English-German and English-French. It moves past the previous best recurrent, convolutional and ensemble systems because attention alone captures long-range dependencies through shorter paths and joint subspaces. The EN-DE BLEU scores board shows the Transformer big bar above prior ensembles and single models.",
