    {
      "id": "takeaway",
      "title": "What to remember and try next",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "takeaway-1",
          "say": "Attention alone gives both speed and quality in translation. Because parallel direct links replace sequential steps while preserving long dependencies, training runs faster and tested pairs reach new records. The reach is the reported translation tasks, not other modalities. Please ask about why multiple heads beat one head.",
